        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pull Trim with Rim Lock Cylinder for Panic Device</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Night Latch Function Pull Trim with <a href=\"/products/rim-cylinder-lock-global-th1100-rc\">Rim Lock Cylinder</a> (turn key to retract latch, release/remove key to engage latch) for Global Door Controls  <a href=\"/products/touch-bar-rim-exit-device-with-alarm-glo-ed-501alarm-al\"><b>ED-501ALARM Alarm Push Bar Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/exit-door-locks-global-ed-501-al\"><b>ED-501-AL Push Bar Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-global-ed-vr531-al\"><b>ED-VR531 Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/surface-vertical-rod-alarm-exit-device-global-ed-vr531alarm-al\"><b>ED-VR531ALARM Alarm Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a> and other manufacture's <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/pull-trim-for-panic-device-global-ed-pp06501-al\"><b>Pull Plate Only (no lock hole)</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with rim lock cylinder, pull trim, mounting hardware and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global ED-PP05-RC-AL Pull Trim with Rim Cylinder \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Night Latch (ANSI F03) - Turn key to retract door latch on exit device, release/remove key to re-engage.</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Aluminum </li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Height: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 3/8\" Diameter, 4-5/16\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Includes Trim Ring</li>\r\n<li>Includes Rim Cylinder, 5-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
